    "title": "Local Police Managed to Track Down a Wanted Man - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Bonneville County, ID ,\n14 hours ago A local police department tracked down a Work Detail escapee. The Bonneville County Sheriff's Office says they were looking for Braxton Scott Larson. Larson was wanted for walking away from his work detail crew yesterday at around 9:30 a.m. The Bonneville County Sheriff's Office posted on Facebook asking for tips... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
